      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUNDY BLUE (3) led throughout to score two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 8 length 6th at this track (23.26). Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Worth another chance. RED TAPE (8) boasts a strong record this journey with six wins and three minors from 15 tries. Recorded a 7 length win (25.21) in a Grade 5 last time at Maitland. Can feature with the right run. MINECRAFT FUSION (1) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 3rd at this track over 400m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Bold showing expected. DAPHNE ZACAPA (2) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at her latest outing at this circuit.",
